        <h2>8. Refunds and Cancellation</h2>

        <p>We will endeavour to operate a fair and transparent refund and cancellation policy during our alpha period.</p>
        
        <p>If you want to terminate your account before your next billing cycle (i.e. yearly or monthly), we may, at our sole discretion, offer a pro-rata refund for any future period you have prepaid, but you should assume any fees you have paid are non-refundable.</p>

        <p>If we need to terminate your account due to your misuse of the service or breach of this agreement, you will not be entitled to a refund. If we need to terminate your account for any other reason, we will endeavour, with no guarantee, to offer a pro-rata refund for any future period you have prepaid.</p>

        <p>Any refund we do agree to will be processed within 30 days where practically possible.</p>

        <p>If you are on a free plan, this section does not apply.</p>

