        <p>Either of us can terminate this agreement at any time, for any reason, with immediate effect by notifying the other. We may also suspend your access immediately if you misuse the service or breach this agreement.</p>

        <p>When the agreement ends, we will delete or return your data in line with our Privacy Policy.</p>

